  <section id="other-ways-to-get-details">
    <title>Other ways to get details</title>
    <p>
      Speak the current selection presents selected text. It can also report selected objects,
      such as files or spreadsheet cells.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can also present a spreadsheet cell's formula, an object's size and position, or
      details about the current link.
    </p>
    <section id="commands-other-ways-to-get-details">
      <title>Commands</title>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Speak the current selection</gui>
            <keyseq>
              <key>Orca Modifier</key>
              <key>Shift</key>
              <key>Up Arrow</key>
            </keyseq>
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Speak link details</gui> Unbound by default.
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Present size and location of current object</gui>
            Unbound by default.
          </p>
        </item>
